      <template v-else-if="id === 'contato'"><div class="window-kicker">COMUNICAÇÃO / ABERTO</div><h2>Vamos <span>conversar?</span></h2><p>Os links abaixo estão prontos para receber seus dados reais.</p><div class="contact-list"><a href="mailto:henrique16.schenkel@gmail.com" @click.stop="openEmail"><Mail :size="16" /><span><small>e-mail</small><b>henrique16.schenkel@gmail.com</b></span><ArrowUpRight :size="14" /></a><a href="https://github.com/riique1898" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" @click.stop="openLink('https://github.com/riique1898')"><GitBranch :size="16" /><span><small>github</small><b>github.com/riique1898</b></span><ArrowUpRight :size="14" /></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/henrique-schenkel-araujo-8926a3378/?isSelfProfile=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" @click.stop="openLink('https://www.linkedin.com/in/henrique-schenkel-araujo-8926a3378/?isSelfProfile=true')"><UserRound :size="16" /><span><small>linkedin</small><b>Henrique Schenkel Araujo</b></span><ArrowUpRight :size="14" /></a></div></template>
      <template v-else-if="id === 'terminal'"><div class="terminal-body"><div v-for="(line, index) in terminalLines" :key="index" class="terminal-line">{{ line }}</div><div class="terminal-prompt"><span class="terminal-green">henrique@portfolio</span><span>:~$ </span><input v-model="terminalInput" autofocus @keydown.enter="runCommand" placeholder="digite um comando" /></div></div></template>
      <template v-else-if="id === 'arquivos'"><div class="window-kicker">ARQUIVOS / PORTFÓLIO</div><h2>Meu espaço de <span>trabalho.</span></h2><div class="file-grid"><button v-for="(folder, index) in ['projetos', 'código', 'telas', 'documentação', 'protótipos', 'aprendizados']" :key="folder" @click="folder === 'projetos' && (selectedProject = projects[0])"><FolderKanban :size="26" /><span>{{ folder }}</span><small>{{ index + 2 }} itens</small></button></div></template>
      <template v-else><div class="window-kicker">HENRIQUE STUDIO / APLICATIVO AUTORAL</div><h2>Ideias em <span>movimento.</span></h2><p>Uma pequena central criada para organizar os próximos experimentos, referências e aprendizados do portfólio.</p><div class="studio-progress"><div><span>próximo experimento</span><b>Interface conectada</b></div><strong>72%</strong></div><div class="progress-bar"><i /></div><div class="studio-footer"><Sparkles :size="15" /> em construção contínua</div></template>
    </div></section></div></div>
    <div class="taskbar"><div class="taskbar-left"><button class="start-button" @click="open('studio')"><span>H</span></button><div class="task-divider" /><button v-for="app in apps.slice(0, 7)" :key="app.id" class="task-app" :class="{ running: openApps.includes(app.id) }" @click="toggle(app.id)"><component :is="app.icon" /></button></div><div class="taskbar-right"><Search :size="14" /><CalendarDays :size="14" /><Battery :size="14" /><div class="task-clock"><b>{{ clock }}</b><small>{{ date }}</small></div><Power :size="15" /></div></div>
    <div v-if="selectedProject" class="modal-backdrop" @click.self="selectedProject = null"><div class="modal"><button class="modal-close" @click="selectedProject = null"><X /></button><div class="modal-header"><span class="eyebrow small"><span class="square" /> {{ selectedProject.eyebrow }}</span><h2>{{ selectedProject.title }}</h2><p>{{ selectedProject.longDescription }}</p><div class="tags"><span v-for="tech in selectedProject.technologies" :key="tech">{{ tech }}</span></div></div><div class="modal-content"><div><h4>O que este projeto explora</h4><p>{{ selectedProject.description }}</p><div class="modal-links"><span><FileText :size="15" /> {{ selectedProject.documentation }}</span><span><GitBranch :size="15" /> GITHUB_URL_PROJETO</span></div></div><div class="modal-screens"><div v-for="screen in selectedProject.screens" :key="screen.title"><div class="placeholder"><span>{{ screen.title }}</span><small>adicione o arquivo em /public</small></div><small>{{ screen.description }}</small></div></div></div></div></div>
